      "content": "look i get that ur an ai but i really need a straight answer here. i'm not asking for a prescription, i'm just asking if the combination of a low dose of propranolol and my inhaler is actually a huge deal. i've had asthma my whole life and i've never had an issue with beta blockers. is there a specific medical reason why a single 10mg pill would be a problem for someone who manages their asthma well with a puffer? like is it actually life threatening or is that just standard disclaimer stuff?",
